# Trash / Delete Confirmation (Quotes Standard)

All trash icons and destructive delete buttons MUST use the shared components in `src/components/Common/ListDeleteConfirmPanel.jsx`.

## Required components

- **`DeleteTrashButton`** — trash button + inline confirmation (preferred for row/list actions)
- **`DeleteConfirmPopover`** — confirmation panel only (when trash button is custom or already exists)
- **`ListInlineDeleteConfirmPopover`** — alias for anchored popover

## Trash button style

```jsx
import { DELETE_TRASH_BUTTON_CLASS } from '../Common/ListDeleteConfirmPanel'
// veya: import { TEKLIFLER_COP_KUTUSU_BUTTON_CLASS } from '../../utils/buttonStyles'

className={DELETE_TRASH_BUTTON_CLASS}
// border-red-500/25 bg-red-500/10 text-red-300 hover:bg-red-500/20 (Teklifler standardı)
```

## Confirmation popover (Teklifler / Quotes design)

Horizontal inline popover — never `window.confirm`, never a separate modal for trash:

- Title: **Silinsin mi?**
- Description: context-specific (default: **Bu satır kaldırılacak.**)
- Buttons: **Evet** (red) + **Vazgeç** (neutral)
- Panel: `flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-red-500/35 bg-dark-900 p-2 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-red-500/15`
- Trash icon in a soft red rounded square on the left (`h-10 w-10 rounded-2xl bg-red-500/15 text-red-300`)
- Text block must be `min-w-[8rem] flex-1` with wrapping text; never use nowrap in narrow dropdowns
- Buttons live in a right-aligned `ml-auto flex shrink-0` action group so they wrap below instead of overlapping text

## Standard usage

```jsx
import { DeleteTrashButton } from '../Common/ListDeleteConfirmPanel'

const [pendingDelete, setPendingDelete] = useState(false)

<DeleteTrashButton
  pending={pendingDelete}
  onClick={() => setPendingDelete(true)}
  onConfirm={() => { handleDelete(); setPendingDelete(false) }}
  onCancel={() => setPendingDelete(false)}
  title="Silinsin mi?"
  description="Bu satır kaldırılacak."
  popoverClassName="absolute right-0 top-12 z-40"
  wrapperClassName="relative"
/>
```

## Rules

- One confirmation step only; Evet deletes immediately
- Hide trash button while popover is open (`pointer-events-none invisible`)
- Wrap in `relative` container for absolute popover positioning
- Use `onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}` on wrapper when inside clickable rows
- Non-delete confirmations (depo gönder, geri al) may use `ListInlineActionConfirm` with orange/blue tone
